## 7. Daily Expense Entry

This is one of the most important features.

Make adding an individual expense extremely fast.

### Required fields

- Expense Date: Default to today's date.
- Item / Expense Name.
- Amount (₹).
- Category.
- Subcategory.
- Payment Method.

### Optional fields

