### Payment methods

Provide these default options:

- Cash
- UPI
- Bank Transfer
- Debit / Credit Card
- Credit / Udhaar
- Other

Allow the owner to add custom payment methods from Settings.

### Payment status

Provide:

- Paid
- Partially Paid
- Unpaid

For partially paid and unpaid expenses, show the remaining amount clearly.

The owner should be able to update an unpaid expense when payment is made.

### Form behaviour

- Date automatically defaults to today.
- Amount should use numeric input.
- Automatically calculate quantity × unit price when both are entered.
- Allow manual amount entry.
- Show category and subcategory selections clearly.
- Validate all required fields.
- Prevent zero or negative expense amounts.
- Show a clear success message after saving.
- Reset the form after successful submission.
- Provide a Save and Add Another action.

The application must not create duplicate records when a save operation is retried.

